---
import '../design/design-aids.css';
import SketchSheet from '../design/SketchSheet.astro';
import SketchArrow from '../design/SketchArrow.astro';
---
<figure class="design-aid design-figure paper-surface boundary-outcomes" aria-labelledby="boundary-outcomes-title">
  <span class="plate-number">Illustration · One purchase, two possible endings</span>
  <p class="figure-title" id="boundary-outcomes-title">Commit and rollback outcomes</p>
  <div class="before"><span>Before checkout</span><strong>P7: 3 available · O14: absent · O14’s lines: absent</strong></div>
  <div class="transaction">
    <span class="bracket-label">One database transaction</span>
    <div class="changes">
      <SketchSheet><p class="panel-title">Stock</p><p>P7 available</p><strong>3 → 1</strong><small>Two mugs reserved</small></SketchSheet>
      <SketchSheet><p class="panel-title">Order</p><p>O14 for C4</p><strong>New record</strong><small>The purchase’s identity</small></SketchSheet>
      <SketchSheet><p class="panel-title">Order line</p><p>O14 · line 1</p><strong>P7 × 2</strong><small>€20 for each mug</small></SketchSheet>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="endings">
    <section><div class="arrow"><SketchArrow direction="down" /><span>COMMIT</span></div><SketchSheet tone="teal"><p class="panel-title">Purchase recorded</p><p>P7: <strong>1 available</strong></p><p>O14 and its line <strong>present</strong></p></SketchSheet></section>
    <section><div class="arrow"><SketchArrow direction="down" /><span>ROLLBACK</span></div><SketchSheet tone="amber"><p class="panel-title">Purchase abandoned</p><p>P7: <strong>3 available</strong></p><p>O14 and its line <strong>absent</strong></p></SketchSheet></section>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Read the endings as alternatives. Commit keeps the changes made by this transaction. Rollback discards them, including the stock reduction if it happened before a later failure. Neither ending leaves this purchase half-recorded. Other transactions’ work is outside this drawing.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .before { padding:.6rem 0 1.2rem; }
  .before span,.before strong { display:block; }
  .before span { color:var(--color-text-secondary); font-size:.8rem; margin-bottom:.4rem; }
  .transaction { position:relative; border:1px dashed var(--color-text-secondary); padding:1.8rem .7rem .8rem; }
  .bracket-label { position:absolute; top:-.7rem; left:.7rem; background:var(--paper-background); padding:0 .4rem; font:.8rem/1.4 var(--font-sans); }
  .changes { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:.7rem; }
  .changes strong { font:500 1.05rem/1.4 var(--font-mono); }
  .changes small { display:block; margin-top:.7rem; color:var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .endings { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:1rem; }
  .endings > section { margin:0; }
  .arrow { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; margin:.5rem 0; }
  .arrow span { font:.8rem/1.4 var(--font-mono); }
  @media(max-width:560px) { .changes,.endings { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .changes small { margin-top:.4rem; } }
</style>
